{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/bf87155c5f3d4fc51644f3d2683d717d.avif?t=1774281168\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf28\ufe0f <strong>North Hunt | The Viking Evolution of West Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You thought you mastered the Wild West\u2026 now try surviving the North.<br>From the creators of <i>West Hunt</i>, <strong>North Hunt</strong> throws you into a Viking-age village where every villager could be a thief in disguise and every mistake could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Snow crunches under your boots. Someone nearby is fishing... or pretending to. You look again \u2014 too late. The hunt has already begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built on the chaotic fun that made <i>West Hunt</i> a hit, <strong>North Hunt</strong> is a complete evolution: new systems, smarter A.I., and a world that turns social deception into an art form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/ebb91d9e75943f631a2205bd0f25e4d2.poster.avif?t=1774281168\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/ebb91d9e75943f631a2205bd0f25e4d2.webm?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/ebb91d9e75943f631a2205bd0f25e4d2.mp4?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Precision Counts. Fail, and You\u2019re out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Skill checks now decide your fate <strong>one slip,</strong> <strong>one mistimed move</strong>, and suspicion spreads like wildfire. Every mission you complete pulls you deeper into the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/e01649f308a4aaec7eb97af3b0c1726d.poster.avif?t=1774281168\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/e01649f308a4aaec7eb97af3b0c1726d.webm?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/e01649f308a4aaec7eb97af3b0c1726d.mp4?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Chief or Thief | Choose Your Side</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as the cunning <strong>Thief</strong> blending into the village or the fearless <strong>Chief</strong> hunting down impostors. Each class has new powers, perks, and ways to outsmart the other, <i><strong>no two hunts are ever the same</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/3e942c3f1cf744cfd6fc2c814c334679.poster.avif?t=1774281168\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/3e942c3f1cf744cfd6fc2c814c334679.webm?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/3e942c3f1cf744cfd6fc2c814c334679.mp4?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2744\ufe0f <strong>A Living Viking World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a Nordic village filled with secrets: from <strong>snowy forests and longhouses</strong> to <strong>bustling markets and sacred ruins</strong>.<br>Every NPC, noise, and clue hides a piece of the story and sometimes, your enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Learn to read the environment, or fall victim to it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/135bbfe65a6ef34c0a7590746d7a9c9f.poster.avif?t=1774281168\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/135bbfe65a6ef34c0a7590746d7a9c9f.webm?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/135bbfe65a6ef34c0a7590746d7a9c9f.mp4?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>From West to North | The Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built on everything players loved about <i>West Hunt</i> and refined through years of feedback, <strong>North Hunt</strong> delivers the next level of social deduction gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More strategy. More tension. More \u201cDid you just see that?!\u201d moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642850?t=1774281168","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642850?t=1774281168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/a5f204fa679d292101fbd2755a7e3e343dcdd579/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774281168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/a5f204fa679d292101fbd2755a7e3e343dcdd579/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774281168","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/bf87155c5f3d4fc51644f3d2683d717d.avif?t=1774281168\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf28\ufe0f <strong>North Hunt | The Viking Evolution of West Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You thought you mastered the Wild West\u2026 now try surviving the North.<br>From the creators of <i>West Hunt</i>, <strong>North Hunt</strong> throws you into a Viking-age village where every villager could be a thief in disguise and every mistake could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Snow crunches under your boots. Someone nearby is fishing... or pretending to. You look again \u2014 too late. The hunt has already begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built on the chaotic fun that made <i>West Hunt</i> a hit, <strong>North Hunt</strong> is a complete evolution: new systems, smarter A.I., and a world that turns social deception into an art form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/ebb91d9e75943f631a2205bd0f25e4d2.poster.avif?t=1774281168\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/ebb91d9e75943f631a2205bd0f25e4d2.webm?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/ebb91d9e75943f631a2205bd0f25e4d2.mp4?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Precision Counts. Fail, and You\u2019re out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Skill checks now decide your fate <strong>one slip,</strong> <strong>one mistimed move</strong>, and suspicion spreads like wildfire. Every mission you complete pulls you deeper into the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/e01649f308a4aaec7eb97af3b0c1726d.poster.avif?t=1774281168\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/e01649f308a4aaec7eb97af3b0c1726d.webm?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/e01649f308a4aaec7eb97af3b0c1726d.mp4?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Chief or Thief | Choose Your Side</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as the cunning <strong>Thief</strong> blending into the village or the fearless <strong>Chief</strong> hunting down impostors. Each class has new powers, perks, and ways to outsmart the other, <i><strong>no two hunts are ever the same</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/3e942c3f1cf744cfd6fc2c814c334679.poster.avif?t=1774281168\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/3e942c3f1cf744cfd6fc2c814c334679.webm?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/3e942c3f1cf744cfd6fc2c814c334679.mp4?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2744\ufe0f <strong>A Living Viking World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a Nordic village filled with secrets: from <strong>snowy forests and longhouses</strong> to <strong>bustling markets and sacred ruins</strong>.<br>Every NPC, noise, and clue hides a piece of the story and sometimes, your enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Learn to read the environment, or fall victim to it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/135bbfe65a6ef34c0a7590746d7a9c9f.poster.avif?t=1774281168\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/135bbfe65a6ef34c0a7590746d7a9c9f.webm?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/135bbfe65a6ef34c0a7590746d7a9c9f.mp4?t=1774281168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>From West to North | The Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built on everything players loved about <i>West Hunt</i> and refined through years of feedback, <strong>North Hunt</strong> delivers the next level of social deduction gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More strategy. More tension. More \u201cDid you just see that?!\u201d moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["NewGen"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/555e77ea351845d31f1efd266612962cebb46289/header.jpg?t=1774281168","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3642850/186928853/c1cb20ce0b5d8f8cef9268ec8f21241b560f59f8/1767005066/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767014011","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3642850/186928853/c1cb20ce0b5d8f8cef9268ec8f21241b560f59f8/1767005066/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767014011","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3642850/186928853/c1cb20ce0b5d8f8cef9268ec8f21241b560f59f8/1767005066/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767014011","id":257256607,"name":"Devlog #2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257256607/21a7f626bde1ea9d26af6bbdedc40c7a4d0178f5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767014011"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3642850/421499077/b8c3dca8026d6cce299cab26642876056b8423db/1760972945/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760978715","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3642850/421499077/b8c3dca8026d6cce299cab26642876056b8423db/1760972945/dash